                <div class="azure-notes-content">
                    <pre class="azure-notes-text">7. CMD

The CMD instruction specifies the default command to run when a container starts. It can also
provide default arguments for the ENTRYPOINT instruction.

Example:

CMD [&quot;program-foreground&quot;]

CMD [&quot;executable&quot;, &quot;program1&quot;, &quot;program2&quot;]

Note: If you have both ENVIRONMENT and CMD, they are combined together.</pre>
